 "questionType": "단답형",
 "content": "다음을 계산하시오.\n⑴ $7p^{6}\\times 8q^{9}$\n⑵ $-6m^{8}n^{7}\\times m^{6}n^{9}$\n⑶ $9x^{6}y^{7}\\times\\left(\\frac{y^{6}}{x^{3}}\\right)^{2}$\n⑷ $\\left(-7a^{9}b^{6}\\right)^{2}\\times\\left(\\frac{b^{7}}{a^{8}}\\right)^{2}$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $56p^{6}q^{9}$ ⑵ $-6m^{14}n^{16}$ ⑶ $9y^{19}$ ⑷ $49a^{2}b^{26}$",
 "solution": "⑴ $7\\times 8\\times p^{6}\\times q^{9}=56p^{6}q^{9}$\n⑵ $(-6)\\times m^{8}\\times m^{6}\\times n^{7}\\times n^{9}=-6m^{14}n^{16}$\n⑶ $9x^{6}y^{7}\\times\\frac{y^{12}}{x^{6}}=9\\times x^{6}\\times\\frac{1}{x^{6}}\\times y^{7}\\times y^{12}=9y^{19}$\n⑷ $49a^{18}b^{12}\\times\\frac{b^{14}}{a^{16}}=49\\times a^{18}\\times\\frac{1}{a^{16}}\\times b^{12}\\times b^{14}=49a^{2}b^{26}$\n따라서 ⑴ $56p^{6}q^{9}$ ⑵ $-6m^{14}n^{16}$ ⑶ $9y^{19}$ ⑷ $49a^{2}b^{26}$",
 "score": null,
